      "side": 1,
      "message": "I verified this against the different Redfish schemas at \nhttp://redfish.dmtf.org/schemas\n\nA few things to note:\nPhysicalContext in Redfish is a standalone schema (PhysicalContext.json) — it is not defined inside Power.json or Thermal.json. \nThose schemas reference it via $ref. So it is already used across Temperature, Fan, Voltage, PowerControl etc.\n\nThe Redfish enum already includes inventory-level values like Board, SystemBoard, Chassis — so associating PhysicalContext with inventory items is fully consistent with the Redfish spec.",
